title: "Upload: asking before a dropped file replaces another"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Waiting for a drop
  s1: Asking, a file has the name
  s2: Asking, a folder or link has the name
  s3: Uploading
  s4: Uploads listed as complete, skipped or cancelled
  s5: Failed, Retry shown
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: files dropped
  s0 --> s2: files dropped
  s0 --> s3: files dropped
  s1 --> s3: answers
  s1 --> s4: presses Cancel all or answers
  s2 --> s3: answers
  s2 --> s4: presses Cancel all or answers
  s3 --> s4: a file is written or presses Cancel all
  s3 --> s5: a send fails
  s3 --> s1: the store refuses: another writer took the name
  s3 --> s2: the store refuses: another writer took the name
  s5 --> s3: presses Retry
  s5 --> s4: presses Cancel all
